title: Web Shell File Upload Attempt
id: 00c5eaf0-63be-4e8c-92f5-c71026b97e11
status: experimental
description: Detects HTTP POST uploads whose target or content indicates a server-side script (.php, .jsp, .aspx, .ashx) being written into a web-accessible directory, the delivery step for a web shell.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1505/003/
logsource:
  category: webserver
detection:
  selection:
    cs-method: 'POST'
    cs-uri-stem|endswith:
      - '.php'
      - '.jsp'
      - '.aspx'
      - '.ashx'
      - '.jspx'
  condition: selection
fields:
  - cs-uri-query
  - cs-uri-stem
  - c-ip
falsepositives:
  - Legitimate uploads to script endpoints
level: high
tags:
  - attack.persistence
  - attack.t1505.003
